  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into small chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, add sesame seeds, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato chunks between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-656fb2a838e51a4a51a2fc55-6860d91c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut tomato into wedges.\n• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Trim and roughly chop pea pods.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-656fb2a838e51a4a51a2fc55-75bc7b52.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook ginger paste and spring onion, until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Add soy sauce mix and brown sugar to ginger oil mixture and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-656fb2a838e51a4a51a2fc55-c65547bf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, add vegetable gyozas, flat-side down, in a single layer. Cook, until starting to brown, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water (watch out, it may spatter!) and cover tightly with foil or a lid.\n• Cook until the water has evaporated and gyozas are tender and softened, 4-5 minutes. TIP: Cook gyozas in batches for the best results.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-656fb2a838e51a4a51a2fc55-86f9df11.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, snacking tomatoes, pea pods, Japanese style dressing and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-656fb2a838e51a4a51a2fc55-f8fe2044.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sesame chunks, vegetable gyozas and Japanese mixed leaf salad between plates.\n• Spoon gyoza sauce over gyozas.\n• Serve with plant-based mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-656fb2a838e51a4a51a2fc55-ccac03e5.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
